  "content_units": [
    {
      "id": "u1",
      "kind": "ANALOGY",
      "label": "Analogy of dozen to explain the mole and Avogadro's number",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "मोल (Mole) रसायन विज्ञान में पदार्थ की **बहुत बड़ी संख्या में कणों को गिनने** की इकाई है। जैसे हम चीज़ों को गिनने के लिए “दर्जन” कहते हैं—\n\n- 1 दर्जन = 12 वस्तुएँ  \nवैसे ही,\n- **1 मोल = \\(6.022 \\times 10^{23}\\) कण**\n\nइस संख्या को **एवोगैड्रो संख्या (Avogadro’s number)** कहते हैं।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {},
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "everyday",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "excerpt_index": 0,
            "quote": "जैसे हम चीज़ों को गिनने के लिए “दर्जन” कहते हैं—\n\n- 1 दर्जन = 12 वस्तुएँ"
          }
        ]
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The analogy accurately links the everyday counting unit 'dozen' (12 items) to the chemical counting unit 'mole' (6.022 x 10^23 particles).",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u2",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Reason why the mole unit is needed in chemistry",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "परमाणु, अणु और आयन इतने छोटे होते हैं कि उन्हें एक-एक करके गिनना संभव नहीं है। उदाहरण के लिए, एक पानी की बूंद में भी अकल्पनीय रूप से बहुत सारे पानी के अणु होते हैं।\n\nइसलिए वैज्ञानिकों ने कणों की विशाल संख्या को व्यक्त करने के लिए “मोल” का उपयोग किया।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "explanation"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "everyday",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "excerpt_index": 0,
            "quote": "एक पानी की बूंद में भी अकल्पनीय रूप से बहुत सारे पानी के अणु होते हैं।"
          }
        ]
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Accurately explains the physical rationale for defining a macroscopic unit for microscopic entities like atoms and molecules.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u3",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Definition of particle types corresponding to 1 mole of different substances",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "1 मोल पदार्थ में हमेशा:\n\n\\[\n6.022 \\times 10^{23}\n\\]\n\nकण होते हैं।\n\nकण का अर्थ पदार्थ के अनुसार बदल सकता है:\n\n| पदार्थ | 1 मोल में क्या होगा? |\n|---|---|\n| हीलियम (He) | \\(6.022 \\times 10^{23}\\) हीलियम परमाणु |\n| ऑक्सीजन गैस (\\(O_2\\)) | \\(6.022 \\times 10^{23}\\) ऑक्सीजन अणु |\n| सोडियम क्लोराइड (NaCl) | \\(6.022 \\times 10^{23}\\) NaCl सूत्रक इकाइयाँ |\n| इलेक्ट्रॉन | \\(6.022 \\times 10^{23}\\) इलेक्ट्रॉन |",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "explanation"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Correctly defines how the constituent particle varies depending on whether the substance is monatomic, molecular, ionic, or subatomic.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u4",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Definition and units of molar mass",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "किसी पदार्थ के **1 मोल का द्रव्यमान** उसका **मोलर द्रव्यमान** कहलाता है।\n\nइसकी इकाई होती है:\n\n\\[\n\\text{ग्राम प्रति मोल (g/mol)}\n\\]\n\nमोलर द्रव्यमान संख्यात्मक रूप से परमाणु/आणविक द्रव्यमान के बराबर होता है, पर उसकी इकाई g/mol होती है।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "explanation"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Correctly defines molar mass as the mass of 1 mole of a substance in g/mol, noting that its numerical value equals atomic/molecular mass in unified atomic mass units.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u5",
      "kind": "EXAMPLE",
      "label": "Molar mass and particle count for carbon",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "कार्बन का परमाणु द्रव्यमान = 12 u\n\nअतः कार्बन का मोलर द्रव्यमान:\n\n\\[\n12\\ \\text{g/mol}\n\\]\n\nइसका अर्थ:\n\n\\[\n12\\ \\text{g कार्बन} = 1\\ \\text{मोल कार्बन परमाणु}\n\\]\n\nऔर इनमें \\(6.022 \\times 10^{23}\\) कार्बन परमाणु होंगे।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "context": "abstract_or_hypothetical",
        "treatment": "worked"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The atomic mass of carbon-12 (12 u) translates correctly to 12 g/mol, which corresponds to 1 mole and 6.022 x 10^23 carbon atoms.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u6",
      "kind": "EXAMPLE",
      "label": "Molar mass and particle count for water",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "पानी का आणविक द्रव्यमान:\n\n\\[\n2(1) + 16 = 18\n\\]\n\nअतः पानी का मोलर द्रव्यमान:\n\n\\[\n18\\ \\text{g/mol}\n\\]\n\nयानि:\n\n\\[\n18\\ \\text{g पानी} = 1\\ \\text{मोल पानी} = 6.022 \\times 10^{23}\\ \\text{पानी के अणु}\n\\]",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "context": "abstract_or_hypothetical",
        "treatment": "worked"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The molecular mass of H2O is calculated correctly as 18, giving a molar mass of 18 g/mol and equating 18 g to 1 mole and 6.022 x 10^23 molecules.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u7",
      "kind": "PROCEDURE",
      "label": "Formula for calculating moles from mass",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "\\[\n\\text{मोलों की संख्या} = \\frac{\\text{दिया गया द्रव्यमान (g)}}{\\text{मोलर द्रव्यमान (g/mol)}}\n\\]\n\nअथवा,\n\n\\[\nn = \\frac{m}{M}\n\\]\n\nजहाँ:  \n- \\(n\\) = मोलों की संख्या  \n- \\(m\\) = द्रव्यमान  \n- \\(M\\) = मोलर द्रव्यमान",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {},
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The standard relationship n = m / M is accurately presented with definitions of variables.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "kind": "EXAMPLE",
      "label": "Worked calculation of moles from mass for water",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "36 g पानी में मोल कितने हैं?\n\nपानी का मोलर द्रव्यमान = 18 g/mol\n\n\\[\nn = \\frac{36}{18} = 2\\ \\text{mol}\n\\]\n\nअर्थात 36 g पानी में 2 मोल पानी है।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "context": "abstract_or_hypothetical",
        "treatment": "worked"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Calculation 36 / 18 = 2 mol is correct.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "kind": "PROCEDURE",
      "label": "Formula for calculating number of particles from moles",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "\\[\n\\text{कणों की संख्या} = \\text{मोल} \\times 6.022 \\times 10^{23}\n\\]",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {},
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The formula correctly multiplies the number of moles by Avogadro's constant to get total particles.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u10",
      "kind": "EXAMPLE",
      "label": "Worked calculation of number of molecules in 2 moles of water",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "2 मोल पानी में अणुओं की संख्या:\n\n\\[\n2 \\times 6.022 \\times 10^{23}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= 1.2044 \\times 10^{24}\n\\]\n\nअर्थात 2 मोल पानी में \\(1.2044 \\times 10^{24}\\) पानी के अणु होते हैं।",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "context": "abstract_or_hypothetical",
        "treatment": "worked"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The arithmetic 2 * 6.022 x 10^23 = 1.2044 x 10^24 is correct.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u11",
      "kind": "PROCEDURE",
      "label": "Formula for calculating moles from number of particles",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "\\[\n\\text{मोल} = \\frac{\\text{कणों की संख्या}}{6.022 \\times 10^{23}}\n\\]",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {},
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Correctly states that moles equal total particle count divided by Avogadro's number.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u12",
      "kind": "EXAMPLE",
      "label": "Worked calculation of moles from given number of oxygen molecules",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "यदि किसी नमूने में \\(3.011 \\times 10^{23}\\) ऑक्सीजन अणु हैं, तो मोल होंगे:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{3.011 \\times 10^{23}}{6.022 \\times 10^{23}} = 0.5\\ \\text{mol}\n\\]",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "context": "abstract_or_hypothetical",
        "treatment": "worked"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "Calculation (3.011 x 10^23) / (6.022 x 10^23) = 0.5 mol is correct.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u13",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Molar volume of a gas at STP and related conversion formula",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "मानक ताप और दाब (STP: 0°C और 1 atm) पर:\n\n\\[\n1\\ \\text{मोल गैस} = 22.4\\ \\text{लीटर}\n\\]\n\nइसलिए:\n\n\\[\n\\text{मोल} = \\frac{\\text{गैस का आयतन (L)}}{22.4}\n\\]",
          "occurrence": 0
